*.onnx
*.mlx

# Local review dumps — screenshots and recordings only. The confirmed rules (visual-baseline.json,
# interaction-baseline.json) and the reports ARE tracked: without them a later reviewer has no
# sentence to cite, and re-freezing a baseline costs a whole confirmation session.
docs/cross-exam/**/*.png
docs/cross-exam/**/*.jpg
docs/cross-exam/**/*.mov
docs/cross-exam/**/*.webm
.playwright-mcp/
docs/superpowers/runs/
